encies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nRegression from #108647\n\n### System information\n\nW10\n\n### Issue description\n\nOutput is a dock now, so...\n\n<img width=\"215\" height=\"90\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c68956f8-684b-4eca-82c5-5ee08aa07c4a\" />\n\nYeah...\n\nThis is a part of a bigger problem. Since bottom docks are now docks, they are subject to the dock tab style setting. Once they all get icons assigned, they may show as icons only, depending on the selected style. You may not want that, so maybe we should have a separate setting for bottom tabs style.\nIt _might_ look weird when you set bottom docks to icons and your Output shows as red dot, buuut, if you want icons only, you get icons only I guess? It's better than forcing one dock to show a text.\n\nEDIT:\nI realized there is an opposite problem too, and it's worse. If you set the style to text-only, the Output will never show the icon 🤦‍♂️ I guess docks need a property to force-show the icon.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Set `interface/editor/dock_tab_style` to Icon Only\n2. Have some errors\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113054/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113054/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}